Per-day equity: `reports/equity_daily.csv` (18 run-days). `ret / max cap` = net pnl over the peak collateral locked. `flags` come from the simulator's reality checks (cross-assumed fills = maker fills inferred from the book crossing us without a print; fill>touch = a fill larger than the resting size at the touch; top3 = pnl concentrated in 3 markets) and from the RiskManager (HALTED = daily-loss / kill file).

